This product includes weights derived from Perch v2, developed by
Google Research and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://www.kaggle.com/models/google/bird-vocalization-classifier

Modifications made in this repository:
  - Converted Perch v2's released ONNX computation graph directly into
    trainable PyTorch modules using onnx2torch, including custom
    converters for three op/version combinations not supported by
    onnx2torch out of the box (Pad @ opset 18, DFT @ opset 17,
    ReduceL2/ReduceMax @ opset 18) -- see
    perchv2_pytorch/onnx_backbone.py for details and verification.
  - Legacy (see legacy/, not recommended -- legacy/README.md explains
    why): extracted backbone weights from the original JAX/Flax
    SavedModel and converted them into a PyTorch state dict compatible
    with timm's `tf_efficientnet_b3`, and reimplemented the
    mel-spectrogram frontend in PyTorch/torchaudio per the
    specification in arXiv 2508.04665, Appendix A.2.

